0},{"name":"limit","type":"int","label":"At most","default":20,"min":1,"max":110,"since":0}],"yields":["view"],"cardStyle":"landscape","pageKinds":["detail"],"paged":false,"title":"Save states","since":8},{"type":"wittyplay.memories","label":"Memories","description":"This profile's save states and kept screenshots, across its games, newest first.","icon":"photo","category":"","params":[{"name":"limit","type":"int","label":"At most","default":24,"min":1,"max":500,"since":0}],"yields":["view","photo"],"cardStyle":"landscape","paged":true,"title":"Memories","since":8},{"type":"wittyplay.privacy","label":"Friends and privacy","description":"The two choices a profile makes about what its friends know, as switches: whether friends see what it plays, and whether it appears online at all.","icon":"users","category":"","yields":["view"],"cardStyle":"tile","paged":false,"title":"Friends and what you play","since":8},{"type":"wittyplay.kidsFriends","label":"A Kids profile's friends","description":"For an administrator: every profile that could be a Kids profile's friend, each a switch that approves or removes it. Nothing for anyone else.","icon":"kids","category":"","params":[{"name":"user","type":"ref","label":"Kids profile","help":"The profile's ID, $item on a page opened about it.","required":true,"since":0}],"yields":["view"],"cardStyle":"tile","paged":false,"title":"Approved friends","since":8},{"type":"wittyplay.controllers","label":"Controllers","description":"Each player of the game this profile is in, and who is playing it. A controller's battery and kind are the device's to show.","icon":"devices","category":"","params":[{"name":"limit","type":"int","label":"At most","default":8,"min":1,"max":8,"since":0}],"yields":["view"],"cardStyle":"landscape","paged":false,"title":"Controllers","since":8},{"type":"wittyplay.library","label":"Games by console","description":"With a console, that console's games by title, in one games library ($library) or every one; with every, all of its games, following the page's filters when filterable. Otherwise, the consoles that have games there, each with how many, opening the library that holds them.","icon":"game","category":"","params":[{"name":"library","type":"library","label":"Library","help":"$library on a games library's page; empty for every games library.","since":0},{"name":"console","type":"string","label":"Console","help":"A console's ID, such as snes. Empty: the consoles themselves.","maxLength":40,"since":0},{"name":"every","type":"bool","label":"Every game","help":"Without a console: every game there rather than the consoles, by title.","since":0},{"name":"filterable","type":"bool","label":"Follows the page's filters","help":"With every: the page's FilterBar (genre, score at least, order) narrows and sorts it.","since":0},{"name":"limit","type":"int","label":"At most","default":40,"min":1,"max":500,"since":0}],"yields":["game","view"],"cardStyle":"game","paged":true,"title":"Games","since":8},{"type":"wittyplay.storeConsoles","label":"Cores & emulators: consoles","description":"For an administrator: a row for each console, whether it plays here and on what, opening its own rows. With a console: the core it plays on (a choice), each of its cores to install (its licence accepted), update or remove, with a download's progress, and its BIOS files. Nothing for anyone else.","icon":"disc","category":"","params":[{"name":"console","type":"string","label":"Console","help":"A console's ID, $item on a page opened about it. Empty: every console.","maxLength":64,"since":0}],"yields":["view"],"cardStyle":"tile","paged":false,"title":"Consoles & cores","since":8},{"type":"wittyplay.storeEmulators","label":"Cores & emulators: standalone emulators","description":"For an administrator: each standalone emulator, its consoles, licence and firmware, and rows to accept its licence and install it, update it, stop a download or remove it. Nothing for anyone else.","icon":"devices","category":"","yields":["